      "---",
      "title: Cost centers",
      "description: Charge spend back to the team that owns it.",
      "---",
      "",
      "A cost center is a label that spend is charged back to, such as `platform-eng` or `support`.",
      "Every session's cost lands on exactly one cost center.",
      "",
      "## Where a session's cost center comes from",
      "",
      "1. The agent's own cost center, when it names one.",
      "2. Otherwise, its workspace's cost center.",
      "",
      "Changing an agent's cost center applies to its next session. Sessions already recorded keep",
      "the cost center they had.",
      "",
      "## Group spend by cost center",
      "",
      "Open **Spend** and choose **Cost center** in the grouping control. Each row sums the",
      "sessions charged to that cost center this month, and selecting a row lists them.",
      "",
      "## Export a chargeback statement",
      "",
      "Choose **Export** on the Spend page to download the month as CSV: one row per session, with",
      "its cost center, agent, person, work item and cost.",
      "",
      "## Common questions",
